  "apps": [
    {
      "id": "ghac",
      "name": "广汽本田签到",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/gqbt.png",
      "keys": [
        "ghac_pass",
        "ghac_conf"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "ghac_pass",
          "name": "密码表 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"手机号\":\"密码\"}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "纯密码模式：填 {\"手机号\":\"密码\"}，多账号逗号分隔。配了密码的账号每次运行自动密码登录获取全新会话（token 不再保存复用，无需关心过期/被踢），自动完成签到+浏览5+点赞10+分享2。密码只存手机本地 QX 存储，脚本不放行任何外部上报。没填的账号沿用 ghac_capture.js 捕获的凭据"
        },
        {
          "id": "ghac_conf",
          "name": "任务配置 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"points_delay\":240}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "points_delay=积分入账等待秒数（默认随机180~300，服务端入账有1~2分钟延迟，等完再读才有真实的「今日+N」）。留空走脚本默认。改完保留 JSON 结构，别删整键"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "name": "▶ 立即运行一次",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/ghac_daily.js"
        }
      ],
      "author": "@ygxdyz",
      "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/gqbt.png",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/gqbt.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bingrewards",
      "name": "Bing Rewards",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/bing.png",
      "keys": [
        "bingrewards_conf",
        "bingrewards_pass"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "bingrewards_conf",
          "name": "任务配置 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"per_run\":1}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "per_run=每轮执行账号数（1=轮换模式，多号错峰；0或留空=每轮全跑）。random_delay_max=启动随机延迟分钟数（默认25，手动测试嫌等可填0）。enable_search/enable_quiz/enable_activities 填 false 可关对应任务。留空走脚本内联默认"
        },
        {
          "id": "bingrewards_pass",
          "name": "密码表 (可选, JSON数组)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "[{\"username\":\"a@outlook.com\",\"password\":\"pass\",\"otpauth\":\"\"}]",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "备选登录方式，数组支持多号；有两步验证填 otpauth 完整链接。捕获到的账号优先，与此表不冲突"
        }
      ],
      "author": "@ygxdyz",
      "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/bing.png",
